                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Valparaiso,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-03-29"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 29, 1866</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Notice.</hi>—At the conclusion of the bombardment a
                    Spanish flag will be hoisted at the fore yard-arm of the Numancia, and no
                    subsequent fire will take place without due notice.</p>
                <p>This has been communicated to me by the Spanish admiral.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JOHN RODGERS.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
